title: Sign_Post
---
Sign: ← Hollowmere · → Whisperwood Post
===
title: Path_Closed
---
Lira: Fallen trees block the path. We'll have to find another way later.
===
title: Hunter
---
<<if has_flag("ww_secret")>>
    Hunter: That chest is in the small clearing up north, behind the bushes. Take it, I've no use for it.
<<else>>
    Hunter: From Hollowmere? Careful, the Ashblight grows thicker to the east.
    Hunter: Moss wolves roam here too. Go at them with a spear, and fire; that moss of theirs burns.
    -> \[Ask\] Have you hunted in this forest long?
        Hunter: Twenty seasons. It used to be safe... until the ember in the east began to fade.
        Hunter: Hm, you're a polite one. I'll tell you a secret.
        Hunter: There's an old chest in the small clearing up north. A passing merchant hid it there long ago.
        Lira: Thank you! We'll go and find it.
        <<flag ww_secret>>
    -> Leave
<<endif>>
===
